## Invoice Object Structure

A complete invoice looks like:

```javascript
{
  customerId: "C-001",
  issueDate: "2025-10-07",
  status: "draft" | "issued",
  number: "INV-2025-0001", // only if issued
  lines: [
    {
      sku: "DEV-HOUR",
      name: "Development (hour)",
      qty: 5,
      unitPrice: 9500, // cents, without VAT
      vatRate: 21 // percent
    }
    // ...
  ]
}
```

